    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Hingston Studio is an independent London creative agency founded in 1997 by Tom Hingston (born 1973, Central St Martins graduate, early career with Neville Brody). The studio is approximately 9 people (Tom Hingston Creative Director/Founder, Jo Hingston Strategy Director/Partner, Sam Jay Senior Designer, plus designers and animators). Senior/Creative Director level with 28 years of practice and a deep roster across luxury, music, fashion and culture: Apple, Dior, Nick Cave, Massive Attack, Rolling Stones, Lady Gaga, Alexander McQueen, Netflix, Formula 1, Serpentine Galleries, V&A. Two Grammy nominations for music art direction; D&AD Pencil for exhibition design (Veuve Clicquot Widow Series, 2018). Work spans brand identity, CGI/animation, film, exhibition design, packaging, type design, digital and web design. Work Status: Studio (Tom Hingston is principal and founder). Autonomy 5: 28-year principal-led studio with full creative direction mandate across major luxury, culture and music clients.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-07-08T00:45:15",
      "set_by": "agent"
    },
